Package: mapuce
Title: Convert RP INDCVI detail files to semantic data input for MAPUCE models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Alexis", "Bourgeois", , "acidybee@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-8513-1715"))
Description: The mapuce package contains a set of functions to check, extract and transform variables from the RP indcvi file from the french census, in order to prepare them for mapuce models.
